Subject: [PATCH] Add ASPEED AST2600 I2Cv2 controller driver

Add AST2600 i2cv2 new register set driver.

lore link:
https://lore.kernel.org/lkml/20241007035235.2254138-1-ryan_chen@aspeedtech.com/
